<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>专业训练 · GUCCANG</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/exercise_professional.css?v=1">
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=1"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=1">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="pro-shell">
        <header class="pro-header">
            <a class="brand" href="/exercise"><span>G</span><strong>专业训练</strong></a>
            <a class="quiet-link" href="/exercise">返回锻炼记录</a>
        </header>

        <section class="pro-hero">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">渐进式自重训练</p>
                <h1>选对当前这一级，<br>再稳稳地向前一级。</h1>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-note">六类核心动作，十级渐进。这里负责制定训练，完成情况仍回到每日锻炼中记录。</p>
        </section>

        <div id="loadingState" class="loading-state">正在整理训练目录…</div>
        <div id="professionalApp" class="professional-app" hidden>
            <section class="movement-studio" aria-labelledby="movementTitle">
                <nav id="movementNav" class="movement-nav" aria-label="动作分类"></nav>

                <div class="movement-heading">
                    <span id="movementIcon" class="movement-icon"></span>
                    <div>
                        <p id="movementTarget" class="movement-target"></p>
                        <h2 id="movementTitle"></h2>
                        <p id="movementSummary" class="movement-summary"></p>
                    </div>
                    <span id="movementEquipment" class="equipment-pill"></span>
                </div>

                <div class="level-section">
                    <div class="section-label">
                        <span>当前进阶</span>
                        <strong id="currentLevelLabel"></strong>
                    </div>
                    <div id="levelTrack" class="level-track" role="group" aria-label="选择当前动作级别"></div>
                </div>

                <article id="levelCard" class="level-card">
                    <div class="level-card-head">
                        <div>
                            <p id="levelDifficulty" class="difficulty"></p>
                            <h3 id="levelName"></h3>
                        </div>
                        <div id="prescription" class="prescription"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="training-facts">
                        <div><span>节奏</span><strong id="levelTempo"></strong></div>
                        <div><span>休息</span><strong id="levelRest"></strong></div>
                        <div><span>器材</span><strong id="levelEquipment"></strong></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="guidance-grid">
                        <div>
                            <h4>动作要点</h4>
                            <ul id="levelCues"></ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4>避免这些</h4>
                            <ul id="levelMistakes"></ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="advance-line">
                        <span>升级参考</span>
                        <strong id="levelAdvance"></strong>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <aside class="plan-builder" aria-labelledby="planTitle">
                <p class="eyebrow">未来七天</p>
                <h2 id="planTitle">安排本周训练</h2>
                <p class="plan-intro">按六类动作当前等级生成计划。计划加入后默认为未完成。</p>

                <label class="date-field">
                    <span>开始日期</span>
                    <input id="startDate" type="date">
                </label>

                <fieldset class="frequency-field">
                    <legend>每周训练</legend>
                    <div id="frequencySwitch" class="frequency-switch">
                        <button type="button" data-days="2">2 天</button>
                        <button type="button" data-days="3">3 天</button>
                        <button type="button" data-days="4">4 天</button>
                    </div>
                    <small id="frequencyHint"></small>
                </fieldset>

                <button id="previewButton" class="preview-button" type="button">预览一周计划</button>
                <div id="planPreview" class="plan-preview" hidden></div>
                <div id="conflictBox" class="conflict-box" hidden>
                    <strong>这七天已有专业计划</strong>
                    <p>替换只会移除未完成的专业项目，已完成项目和手工记录会保留。</p>
                    <button id="replaceButton" type="button">替换未完成计划</button>
                </div>
                <button id="applyButton" class="apply-button" type="button" hidden>加入训练</button>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <footer class="safety-note">
            <strong>训练边界</strong>
            <p id="catalogNotice">疼痛时停止训练；存在伤病或健康风险时先咨询专业人士。</p>
        </footer>
    </main>
    <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <script src="/js/exercise_professional.js?v=1"></script>
</body>
</html>
